eant to be a double agent. He then attacked the Huntik team downstairs but Klaus' forces were held off by [[Dante Vale]]'s Titans. {{source|The Bookshop Hunter}}","text":"This Suit attempted to stop Sophie Casterwill and Zhalia Moon from reaching the lower level of Klaus' bookshop, alongside his Enforcer and Unnamed Suit 037. Zhalia held the pair off, giving the Sophie time to get past them. Afterwards, he declared his annoyance as their battle as Zhalia was meant to be a double agent. He then attacked the Huntik team downstairs but Klaus' forces were held off by Dante Vale's Titans. [The Bookshop Hunter]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]].\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}","text":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans."},{"heading":"Spells Utilized","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Augerfrost]]\n\n{{col-2}}","text":"• Augerfrost"},{"heading":"Bonded Titans","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Enforcer]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"• Enforcer"}],"full_text":"Unnamed Suit 038 is a Suit within the Organization. He operates from Vienna, Austria, under Klaus.\n\nHistory\n\nThis Suit attempted to stop Sophie Casterwill and Zhalia Moon from reaching the lower level of Klaus' bookshop, alongside his Enforcer and Unnamed Suit 037. Zhalia held the pair off, giving the Sophie time to get past them. Afterwards, he declared his annoyance as their battle as Zhalia was meant to be a double agent. He then attacked the Huntik team downstairs but Klaus' forces were held off by Dante Vale's Titans. [The Bookshop Hunter]\n\nAbilities\n\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans.\n\nSpells Utilized\n\n• Augerfrost\n\nBonded Titans\n\n• Enforcer","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox character\n| image     = File:Unnamed Suit 038.png\n| aliases   = \n| relations = \n| base      = [[Vienna, Austria]]\n| group     = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]\n| first     = \"[[The Bookshop Hunter]]\"\n| last      = \n| gender    = Male\n| hair      = Blonde\n| eyes      = \n| va        = \n}}'''Unnamed Suit 038''' is a [[Suit]] within [[the Organization]]. He operates from  [[Vienna, Austria]], under [[Klaus]].\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit attempted to stop [[Sophie Casterwill]] and [[Zhalia Moon]] from reaching the lower level of [[Klaus' bookshop]], alongside his [[Enforcer]] and [[Unnamed Suit 037]]. Zhalia held the pair off, giving the Sophie time to get past them. Afterwards, he declared his annoyance as their battle as Zhalia was meant to be a double agent. He then attacked the Huntik team downstairs but Klaus' forces were held off by [[Dante Vale]]'s Titans. {{source|The Bookshop Hunter}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]].\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n* [[Augerfrost]]\n\n{{col-2}}\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n* [[Enforcer]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:8234","status":"resolved","target_title":"Vienna, Austria","label":"Vienna, Austria","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Vienna%2C_Austria","href":"#/categories?name=Vienna%2C%20Austria"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:4693","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Bookshop Hunter","label":"The Bookshop Hunter","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Bookshop_Hunter","href